SUMMARY:Sobi-sponsored special lecture at EAS 2026 – Tackling pancreatitis risk in severe hypertriglyceridemia through apoC-III inhibition
DESCRIPTION:Tackling pancreatitis risk in severe hypertriglyceridemia through apoC-III inhibition\n\nSobi-sponsored special lecture at EAS 2026\n\nTuesday\, 26 May 2026\n14:45 – 15:30 EEST (UTC+3)\n\nAgenda:\n14:45 – Chair's welcome & agenda – Prof. Børge Nordestgaard (Denmark)\n14:48 – Identify sHTG before pancreatitis hits – Prof. Børge Nordestgaard (Denmark)\n14:58 – Target apoC-III to reduce pancreatitis risk – Prof. Erik Stroes (The Netherlands)\n15:08 – From evidence to clinical practice – Prof. Klaus Parhofer (Germany)\n15:18 – Q&A / Panel discussion & closing remarks – All faculty\n\nThis session is not included in the main event CME/CPD credit.\nThis medical education session is intended for healthcare professionals.
